Z||000006||Tigger||06-21-2001||02:38 PM||||Sorry this has nothing to do with coyotes, but would like to share.  Anyway, I had to do a 60 to 10 in a hurry this past week on the E-way.<P>All the backup was for was a police cruiser on the side of the road and a Ford Explorer facing backwards in the ditch.  Looked like there was a lady still in the drivers seat and from the way it was crumpled, it looked like she did a pole vault in it.<P>No, I didn't check close enough to see if it had Firestones.     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Hopefully she was OK, looked like she was, but I'm sure she got the .... scared out of her.<p>[This message has been edited by Tigger (edited 06-21-2001).]||||reg||1
